            <div xml:id="m-824a0ebd-5cd4-4e11-b34f-979958a63dd2">
              <lg xml:id="m-f9137c8f-8be3-40bf-a3d7-375b2bca01e1">
                <l xml:id="m-df78896c-bcc7-4138-9f07-54a9fd807399" facs="#m-11de3a3d-535c-468b-8c79-adc610bccc6f" label="text-like">Votive Mass of the Holy Angels.</l><l xml:id="m-66d096fc-7752-4547-96ce-949045b220ea" facs="#m-b379a780-9b87-457b-81fd-9d1189dab6b8" label="ambiguous">1275</l><l xml:id="m-2a6d1342-18d7-48f9-a26d-8844a974bcf2" facs="#m-1638bdb5-8569-4179-bd55-ce2ae61e8492" label="text-like">Votive Mass of the Holy Angels.</l><l xml:id="m-82c0f6ab-f912-447a-aafd-937637dc6e6c" facs="#m-64e607a8-a5ce-4061-ba14-b70f8b667cda" label="lyrics-like">Introit. Benedicite Dóminum. D. 1653.</l><l xml:id="m-3cde9b5d-4d2a-4cd0-b519-72628a9d0590" facs="#m-efca2ff6-0452-4b11-b0b8-c32edd8d42c2" label="lyrics-like">Collect. Deus qui miro órdine. p. 1654.</l><l xml:id="m-4859fcf9-8275-401c-bc8a-0eeb8cff5a30" facs="#m-01cb7e03-8118-4e9b-b1e6-094f5381c910" label="ambiguous">Lectio libri Apocalypsis beati Joannis Apostoll. Apoc. S. c.</l><l xml:id="m-c8d2bfde-6659-4367-b3ae-39b4bba14440" facs="#m-a65bae47-4a0e-46da-bd1a-a15ee472a626" label="lyrics-like">TN diébus illis: Audivi vocem An- caelo est, et super terram, et sub</l><l xml:id="m-91825c30-694f-4c16-8cf6-84df3e189a56" facs="#m-610be1d1-34f0-45ed-8ad5-c83380f67921" label="lyrics-like">Lgelórum multórum in circúitu</l><l xml:id="m-422419e5-550a-483c-8f2b-88f7b43f8a21" facs="#m-8430aeeb-9b78-4f97-8ea3-296ffb9c845d" label="ambiguous">terra, et quae sunt in mari, et quae</l><l xml:id="m-f4c7a82b-b093-44c4-989d-d75053be5d29" facs="#m-fea70c39-c614-462b-9b02-a6e3211b2415" label="lyrics-like">in eo, omnes audivi dicéntes: Se¬</l><l xml:id="m-e7c858a0-8bee-426a-85d6-4f781629d92f" facs="#m-77efbbd3-5ac5-457b-8326-5549d4965bee" label="lyrics-like">throni, et animálium, et seniórum:</l><l xml:id="m-c4b9b701-7c84-41d8-a4cf-927b9433dc8c" facs="#m-af50066f-5773-4e1c-8e16-5d77bd72e638" label="lyrics-like">et erat númerus eórum millia mil¬</l><l xml:id="m-e264bb73-0e41-44c8-bd57-846878fd0da7" facs="#m-75965f46-3590-4b3c-b669-027804bb83bf" label="lyrics-like">dénti in throno, et Agno, benedictio,</l><l xml:id="m-3e0e6907-b545-44a0-8a01-803363991fd9" facs="#m-35181c3a-a4cd-4774-93b5-997f055d7fff" label="lyrics-like">et honor, et glória, et potéstas in</l><l xml:id="m-a21b90dc-238b-4885-8494-2488b97a3a4c" facs="#m-c3af21b0-a5d3-4d88-82c1-38721b309391" label="lyrics-like">lium, dicéntium voce magna: Di¬</l><l xml:id="m-5d41f071-6582-4122-be22-4384166f7073" facs="#m-1756ed6f-307c-4099-94e5-6ba8e18ef0ce" label="lyrics-like">saécula saeculórum. Et quátuor</l><l xml:id="m-b5d50eb3-873f-4fb2-bc3e-120653389547" facs="#m-2eeebcc3-d85d-4b5d-b01a-ede9fe578fd2" label="lyrics-like">gnus est Agnus, qui occísus est,</l><l xml:id="m-146251f7-6b53-4fbc-b684-21db1b23d527" facs="#m-f2bf915e-185b-4722-9853-f0e2e3e1ea64" label="lyrics-like">animália dicébant: Amen. Et vi¬</l><l xml:id="m-f23dfc54-0be5-4800-a77f-905ca46ac430" facs="#m-553ccf5c-7b21-4ffc-9e1e-fd57de764c13" label="lyrics-like">ãccipere virtútem, et divinitátem,</l><l xml:id="m-5a0bb446-3c79-46bc-a64d-54519bb62c4f" facs="#m-b0d46a4b-3b6a-4916-bdc0-2b1ea5998f01" label="lyrics-like">et sapiéntiam, et fortitúdinem, et lgínti quátuor senióres cecidérunt</l><l xml:id="m-c8d3d1a8-4fee-4724-b3bd-391f3e07b5ee" facs="#m-aac507b0-d9b9-4b05-843d-a1d4e8b43611" label="lyrics-like">honórem, et glóriam, et benedictió-lin fácies suas: et adoravérunt vi¬</l><l xml:id="m-08e15500-5004-4825-a645-3b3c96d77241" facs="#m-d3d46018-dcf5-4446-88a5-ef92a0d60daa" label="lyrics-like">nem. Et omnem creatúram quae in ]véntem in saécula saeculórum.</l><l xml:id="m-ec436a2d-5ded-44f1-a9ce-a724e28a148f" facs="#m-05523780-8eea-48ac-96e6-f5c4c4a821b4" label="ambiguous">drad.</l><l xml:id="m-2370874a-84f7-4326-897f-3c1c106132d2" facs="#m-b0b27052-ef09-4b98-899a-e933519632e8" label="ambiguous">3.</l><l xml:id="m-65a2c19e-8a19-48a3-a204-6b6e336fc593" facs="#m-9542262a-d62f-4755-9484-6abd503ba2bc" label="lyrics-like">LAudá-te</l><l xml:id="m-6410c62d-7f2b-42bc-bb58-b4e46017958b" facs="#m-050245fd-73f3-493f-9e2d-552877f8c321" label="lyrics-like">"Dóminum de caé¬</l><l xml:id="m-2b13fc2d-ede6-4d02-b464-5da5e2c72dc0" facs="#m-a06c2b5e-c34a-47cd-9022-40ad874782ee" label="ambiguous">lis:</l><l xml:id="m-e6cd85a3-c16a-4dfd-aea3-3640d56a57f4" facs="#m-6319c02b-1036-4193-889d-b79b4f085bf7" label="ambiguous">sis.</l><l xml:id="m-f559e069-0675-4590-a5cc-1b46dd6c89d7" facs="#m-d8781425-8491-4a77-9650-08a268436f1c" label="lyrics-like">laudá- te é-um in ex¬</l><l xml:id="m-1a6ebcbc-a243-4794-9b07-6dc1773536a3" facs="#m-7c127fb8-c53c-4246-87aa-eab18be1ea3f" label="lyrics-like">cél¬</l><l xml:id="m-bdd3afb4-5d7f-45ae-8eb7-fdbe0246fe94" facs="#m-6b5cc2f0-2b0a-4f89-825c-0b2408ead793" label="lyrics-like">v. Laudá-te é¬</l><l xml:id="m-87831f48-d238-49ff-939e-dda811d95339" facs="#m-b10b2fe3-acf5-4249-81b4-569b7b55f940" label="ambiguous">um</l><l xml:id="m-15c6063f-249c-413a-8e7b-2d029bf3626b" facs="#m-907b1b56-2838-4557-a6ae-25e41b65e30f" label="lyrics-like">laudá¬</l><l xml:id="m-90f9030b-97c2-47f0-bdbc-bf41f49f9d56" facs="#m-e9d2be96-be7e-4fa3-b65d-a01eddd6b1e8" label="ambiguous">te</l><l xml:id="m-31e06a1c-2a15-40b3-b720-7d2b3ddc78bd" facs="#m-5db5807f-63fc-4e4f-887f-63ec5d348727" label="lyrics-like">ómnes Ange-li</l><l xml:id="m-aafec769-d6ad-4dd2-8927-a68f95da6f6e" facs="#m-d180721c-53b4-4efb-9f48-ea5e0e9ef177" label="lyrics-like">é- jus:</l><l xml:id="m-ca0a64e9-f69e-4e0d-a474-1060aeaa321f" facs="#m-5d49d3f0-3935-4769-89bf-4c61f65d3f98" label="lyrics-like">ó-mnes Virtú¬</l><l xml:id="m-4202c889-23ce-4605-9fb9-863a11b8967b" facs="#m-2ddd67c2-e511-4fb8-9769-51467d9c7baa" label="lyrics-like">é-um</l><l xml:id="m-15093f9e-5f3c-4899-b7e0-0504f7977a47" facs="#m-6341245c-ac98-4759-ae76-475819ae09c6" label="ambiguous">jus.</l><l xml:id="m-cf28302c-d2ca-46d3-86d7-824ef86171ef" facs="#m-5dd6b047-7a36-4343-84e5-4ef157d5ca69" label="lyrics-like">é¬</l><l xml:id="m-8dd2081a-4228-4e02-b571-d988094f85df" facs="#m-4d02effa-831e-4367-af4b-d647336044b0" label="ambiguous">tes</l></lg>
            </div>
